    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30288" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκίρνημι</span></b> , poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκεράννυμι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mix by pouring in</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρητῆρα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				9.50
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δὲ κέρναις οἶνον</span> (
